Now update the template for P2 controls:
1. toggle button branch → native button with pressed style.
2. textField → secure branch.
3. slider → [step].
4. picker → segmented/radioGroup/menu.
5. datePicker → date/time/dateAndTime.
6. menu → open/close + item selection.

Let me edit node.component.html. Let me find the exact current text of each case.

The toggle case currently:
```
      @case ('toggle') {
        @if (toggleStyle(n) === 'checkbox') {
          ...
        } @else if (toggleStyle(n) === 'button') {
          <ui-button
            [label]="n.text() ?? ''"
            ...
            (click)="onToggleInput(n.id, !checked(n))">
          </ui-button>
        } @else {
          <ui-toggle ...>
        }
      }
```
I'll replace the button branch with a native button.

The textField case:
```
      @case ('textField') {
        <ui-text-field ...>
          @if (n.strings().get(LABEL); as label) { <span prefix>{{ label }}</span> }
        </ui-text-field>
      }
```
Replace with secure branch + ui-text-field.

The slider case:
```
      @case ('slider') {
        <input
          type="range"
          [min]="slider(n).min"
          [max]="slider(n).max"
          [value]="slider(n).value"
          [padding]="m.padding!"
          [color]="m.color!"
          [opacity]="m.opacity!"
          (input)="onSliderInput(n.id, $event)">
      }
```
Add `[step]="slider(n).step ?? 'any'"`.

The picker case:
```
      @case ('picker') {
        <select [value]="selection(n)" (change)="onPickerInput(n.id, $event)">
          @for (opt of pickerOptions(n); track opt.index) {
            <option [value]="opt.index">{{ opt.label }}</option>
          }
        </select>
      }
```
Replace with branches.

The datePicker case:
```
      @case ('datePicker') {
        <input
          type="date"
          [value]="dateValue(n)"
          (change)="onDateInput(n.id, $event)">
      }
```
Replace with branches.

The menu case:
```
      @case ('menu') {
        <div style="position:relative;display:inline-block">
          <div>
            @if (n.children().length > 0) {
              <pathland-node [nodeId]="n.children()[0]" />
            }
          </div>
          <div style="position:absolute;display:none;background:white;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)">
            @for (child of n.children().slice(1); track child) {
              <pathland-node [nodeId]="child" />
            }
          </div>
        </div>
      }
```
Replace with open/close version.

